<section id="why-us" class="fit section">
  <div class="container fit__grid">
    <div class="fit__block">
      <h2 class="section-title">Who This Is For</h2>
      <p>You run a home service business. You are good at the work. You show up, you deliver, and your customers are happy. But you know your revenue doesn't reflect your ability — and you've started to suspect that marketing is the gap. You've hired agencies. Maybe they delivered, maybe they didn't. Either way, you felt like a number, not a partner. Nobody on the other side had ever done the installs. You're not looking for hacks. You're not looking for someone to do it for you. You want to understand the machine — how to build it, how to price it, how to position it so that customers come to you already sold. If that's you, keep reading.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fit__block">
      <h2 class="section-title">What You're Actually Buying</h2>
      <p>You're buying six-week operator coaching: direct access to the person who built The Mounting Man, plus the systems, templates, scripts, and strategies used in the business. You learn how to price, position, market, and operate your own home service company. You do the work in your business.</p>
      <p>This is not a done-for-you marketing service or an installed AI operations team. Joining the Skool foyer does not purchase six-week coaching. The Mounting Man's results are operator proof, not a promise of your results.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

